The BLINC is an accessory for the CISE range of folding beds. 
The BLINC combines the features and functions that are specific to these hospital bed types:
an increased bed width and an increased backrest height;
the availability to add additional features such as a fully motorised leg turn to one segment (one segment CISE B20), a fully electrically controlled inclinator (one segment with control panel CISE B30) or a fully motorized mattress lift / lower (one segment);
the possibility to configure these types of beds to suit particular requirements for operating theatres and intensive care units;
the availability of a number of hospital bed accessories;
conformity to European Directives (CE-marking);
conformity according to EN ISO 9001:2008;
